[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "んん～やっと終わった～～！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Aaaand... we're finally done!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "結構かかったね。もう夜になっちゃった",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That took quite a while. It's already dark out."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まあ、向こうにとっては予期せぬ来客だからね。\n慎重に見極めたいというのは当然さ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, they weren't expecting visitors like us. It's only natural they'd want to be thorough."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "念のため、かつて交易していた頃の書簡を\n持参しておいて正解だったよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Good thing we brought those old trade documents with us."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そういえば、錬金術のことをたくさん聞かれました",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "They sure asked a lot about alchemy."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんでも、この国では錬金術は古くに\n廃れてしまったとかで……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Apparently alchemy died out here long ago..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あれ？\u3000でも、この国にも錬金術士がいるんでしょ？\n話が食い違ってない？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wait, but isn't there supposed to be an alchemist here? Something's not adding up."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうなんだよね。聞いちゃまずい話かと思って、\n黙ってはいたんだけど……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah, I noticed that too. I didn't bring it up since it seemed like a sensitive topic..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……気になるところではあるね。\nベップに、もう一度聞いてみるしかないか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I noticed that too... perhaps we should clarify this matter with Bepp."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "呼んだ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You called?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うおっ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Whoa!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いい反応ね。\n入国審査が終わったようだから、呼びに来たわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's the reaction I was hoping for. I came to get you since it looks like you're done with the immigration procedures."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ねえベップ。\nあんたが言ってた錬金術士の話なんだけど……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey Bepp, about that alchemist you mentioned..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それはまた後で話す。\nそろそろ集会が始まっちゃうから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We'll discuss that later. The gathering's about to start."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "集会……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gathering...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この国では月に一度、星に祈りを捧げるための集会が\n開かれるの",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Once a month, we hold a gathering to offer prayers to the stars."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そこであなたたちをみんなに紹介したいって、\n神官長が言ってたから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The High Priest wants to introduce you all there."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "わぁ……！\u3000こんなにたくさん……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wow...! There's so many people..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ホントに国中の人が集まってるのね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Looks like the whole country really did turn up."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "長年国交が途絶えていたランターナ大陸からの使者が\n星の導きにより、ここにいらっしゃった",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The stars have guided these envoys from the Lantarna to us, after many years without contact."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "神官長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "High Priest"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ランターナ王国第二王子、リヒャルト・ランターナ。\nこのたびは貴国との架け橋となるべく参りました",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I am Richard Lantarna, Second Prince of Lantarna. I come seeking to bridge our nations once more."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そして、この方々は錬金術士――そう、この国を興した\n聖人と同じ、奇跡の術の使い手なのです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And these are alchemists—practitioners of miraculous arts, just like the saint who founded our nation."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "神官長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "High Priest"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "彼女たちはその術を用いて苦難を乗り越え、\nはるばる海を渡って来られました",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Using their craft, they overcame great trials to cross the seas and reach us."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "神官長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "High Priest"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どうぞ、ご挨拶を",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Please, introduce yourself."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "神官長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "High Priest"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "は、はじめまして！\n錬金術士のレスナ・シュテルネンリヒトです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "H-hello everyone! I'm Resna Sternenlicht, an alchemist."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どうぞ、よろしくお願いいたします",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's a pleasure to meet you all!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "我らノーヴァ神聖国はこの出会いを大いに歓迎し、\n願わくは再び友好を結びたいと考えています",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We of Nova warmly welcome this encounter and hope to restore our friendship."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "神官長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "High Priest"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "その第一歩として、まずは「星の案内人」が\nこの国を案内いたしましょう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "As a first step, one of our Star Guides will show you around our nation."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "神官長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "High Priest"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（星の案内人……？）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Star Guide...?)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こちらへ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Please step forward."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "神官長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "High Priest"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "......"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ようこそ、ノーヴァ神聖国へ。\n大陸より遥々お越しくださり、ありがとうございます",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Welcome to Nova. Thank you for making such a long journey from the continent."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私はこの国を訪れる方々を導く「星の案内人」……\nアルビーナ・ジムロックと申します",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I am Alvina Zimlock, a Star Guide tasked with showing visitors around our nation."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（アルビーナ……って、ベップさんが言っていた\n\u3000錬金術士の名前！？）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Alvina... Wait, isn't that the name of the alchemist Bepp mentioned!?)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（この人がそうなの……！？）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Could this be her...!?)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どうぞ、よろしくお願いいたします",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I look forward to assisting you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "は、はいっ！\u3000よろしくお願いします！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Y-yes! Likewise!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]